    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the wonderful world of TCA2024 and experience the ups and downs of collector's life. As an experienced treasure connoisseur, you will search for rare treasures in every corner of the city, accumulating wealth and reputation through wisdom and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay of the game includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role play: Manage your reputation and collections, enhance your influence through appreciation, trading, and socializing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic management: Reasonably allocate time, money, and resources, and develop effective strategies to achieve goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appreciation and Trading: Collecting appraisal fees by appreciating treasures, or obtaining profits by buying low and selling high. Each treasure has unique attributes and rarity that affect its market value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social interaction: Interacting with roles such as judges, businessmen, and other collectors to obtain favorable information or establish relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi Ending System: Based on your choices and strategies, the game will present different endings, testing your decision-making abilities.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the wonderful world of TCA2024 and experience the ups and downs of collector's life. As an experienced treasure connoisseur, you will search for rare treasures in every corner of the city, accumulating wealth and reputation through wisdom and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay of the game includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Role play: Manage your reputation and collections, enhance your influence through appreciation, trading, and socializing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic management: Reasonably allocate time, money, and resources, and develop effective strategies to achieve goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appreciation and Trading: Collecting appraisal fees by appreciating treasures, or obtaining profits by buying low and selling high. Each treasure has unique attributes and rarity that affect its market value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social interaction: Interacting with roles such as judges, businessmen, and other collectors to obtain favorable information or establish relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi Ending System: Based on your choices and strategies, the game will present different endings, testing your decision-making abilities.</p>",
    "short_description": "Yes or No\uff1f is a unique semi simulation management role-playing game, where players will transform into a somewhat famous collector and embark on a challenging and strategic treasure appreciation journey.",
